OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785953904
OL,3,CDrone with explosives and detonator
OL,4,Cfound at German airport
OL,6,FA drone with an explosive device has
OL,7,Fbeen found at an airport in Germany,
OL,8,Fauthorities have said.
OL,10,FAn airport employee found the flying
OL,11,Fobject near the south runway of
OL,12,FLeipzig/Halle Airport, in Saxony,
OL,13,Fafter it was sighted shortly before
OL,14,Fmidnight, according to the police.
OL,16,FAn anti-explosives robot was then
OL,17,Fdeployed to check the object and a
OL,18,Fdetonator was removed from it,
OL,19,Fauthorities said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
