FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785953904
OL,3,CDrone with explosives and detonator
OL,4,Cfound at German airport
OL,6,FPhotos from the scene showed police
OL,7,Ftechnicians with the explosives-
OL,8,Fdisposal robot near a Ukrainian plane,
OL,9,Fwhich was parked at the airport.
OL,11,FThe airport is a major cargo hub, and
OL,12,Fhouses Ukrainian Antonov transport
OL,13,Faircraft.
OL,15,FThere was no immediate information
OL,16,Fabout who was responsible for the
OL,17,Fdrone, and Nato said it had referred
OL,18,Fqueries to German authorities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
