FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785953904
OL,3,CDrone with explosives and detonator
OL,4,Cfound at German airport
OL,6,FFlights were not affected on
OL,7,FWednesday, police said, and there was
OL,8,Fno danger to passengers or airport
OL,9,Fstaff.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, an apparent second flying
OL,12,Fobject also collided with a freight
OL,13,Fairplane that had been forced to abort
OL,14,Fits landing at the airport.
OL,16,FThe plane - reported to be
OL,17,Ftransporting DHL cargo - flew to
OL,18,Fanother German airport, Hannover,
OL,19,Fabout 200 kilometress (125 miles) to
OL,20,Fthe northwest, where officials found
OL,21,Fslight damage.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
