FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785953904
OL,3,CDrone with explosives and detonator
OL,4,Cfound at German airport
OL,6,F"A suspected second unidentified
OL,7,Fflying object collided with a cargo
OL,8,Faircraft after it had taken off again
OL,9,Ffollowing the previous closure of the
OL,10,Frunway," investigators said.
OL,12,FIn 2024, there was a fire at Leipzig/
OL,13,FHalle Airport which happened as part
OL,14,Fof a series of arson attacks across
OL,15,FEurope.
OL,17,FAn incendiary device, designed to
OL,18,Fstart destructive fires, ignited at a
OL,19,Flogistics centre at the airport and
OL,20,Fset fire to a freight container.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785953904
OL,3,CDrone with explosives and detonator
OL,4,Cfound at German airport
OL,6,FWestern security officials suspected
OL,7,FRussian intelligence was behind the
OL,8,Fincident, which saw the flight the
OL,9,Fcontainer was supposed to take be
OL,10,Fdelayed.
OL,12,FGerman Interior Ministry spokesperson
OL,13,FLeonard Kaminski said he did not see a
OL,14,Fconnection between the incidents at
OL,15,Fthis stage.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/5
